function guide(){modal(`<h2>How to Play</h2><p>A crewmate’s job is simple: finish the tasks and find the Impostors. Trust carefully.</p><div class="help-row"><b>CREWMATE</b><span>Use the map to find yellow task markers. Complete tasks, report bodies, and vote out Impostors. Ghosts can still finish tasks.</span></div><div class="help-row"><b>IMPOSTOR</b><span>Blend in, kill when nobody is watching, sabotage systems, and escape through vents. Reach equal numbers to win.</span></div><div class="help-row"><b>EXTRA ROLES</b><span>Practice all 13 roles from the lobby. Shapeshifters copy identities, Phantoms vanish, Vipers dissolve bodies, and crew support roles use C. Detective and Judge abilities are available during meetings. Visual tasks can prove innocence.</span></div><div class="help-row"><b>CONTROLS</b><span>WASD / arrows: move · click floor: walk · E / Space: use · Q: kill · R: report · V: vent · F: sabotage · C: role ability · Tab / M: map · Esc: close / pause. Touch controls included.</span></div><div class="help-row"><b>BOTS</b><span>Bots remember sightings, report bodies, fake tasks, repair sabotage, lie, accuse, and vote from their own evidence. They respond to names, colors, and questions in chat.</span></div><div class="help-row"><b>PLAY ONLINE</b><span>The host shares the six-character room code. Friends join before the match starts; bots fill empty slots. Keep the host’s tab open. Some networks block peer connections.</span></div><p>Win record: ${stats.won} / ${stats.played} matches.</p><button class="au-button primary" id="help-done">GOT IT</button>`);$('#help-done').onclick=closeModal;}
